  {
    "RowId": 41800,
    "Text": "I'm the only one fit to protect her..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41801,
    "Text": "Come! Show me your strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41802,
    "Text": "Only I can protect her!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41803,
    "Text": "Fools... You would stoke the fires of conflict?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41804,
    "Text": "The Light shall usher in peace!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41805,
    "Text": "Come to me, Hraesvelgr!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41806,
    "Text": "I shall weave a new Dragonsong!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41807,
    "Text": "I told you it would make a great necklace."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41808,
    "Text": "Ohhh...it's beautiful! I think it'll really suit you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41809,
    "Text": "Me? But I thought you should have it..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41810,
    "Text": "Is this ice? Where did this come from?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41811,
    "Text": "O Chaotic Dark, descend and quench Light!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41812,
    "Text": "Past...present...future."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41813,
    "Text": "Infinite possibilities...condensed into a single moment!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41814,
    "Text": "Pain shall be fleeting, joy everlasting..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41815,
    "Text": "As I wish it, so shall the river of time flow!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41816,
    "Text": "Still you resist. Then we shall unleash the Light within!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41817,
    "Text": "No! I won't let you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41818,
    "Text": "Aaaaaahhh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41819,
    "Text": "Ryne!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41820,
    "Text": "She won't last much longer!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41821,
    "Text": "Yaaaaaargh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41822,
    "Text": "Hold on, Ryne!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41823,
    "Text": "Ryne, are you alright!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41824,
    "Text": "I am thanks to you, Gaia."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41825,
    "Text": "You're Mitron! Ugh... Aaaaaahhh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41826,
    "Text": "I am Loghrif, servant of Zodiark."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41827,
    "Text": "I shall restore the power of Darkness to this star."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41828,
    "Text": "Her awakening is incomplete... Their memories weaken the link."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41829,
    "Text": "Such impediments to our resonance must be expunged."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41830,
    "Text": "The time is come. Together, we shall rejoin the Darkness!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41831,
    "Text": "We shall bring eternal harmony."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41832,
    "Text": "Tranquility and vitality in perfect balance..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41833,
    "Text": "No one will erase our promise. No one!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41834,
    "Text": "This cacophony... My head..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41835,
    "Text": "So close to realizing our perfect utopia..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41836,
    "Text": "I'll never stop. As many times as it takes!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41837,
    "Text": "When next I return, I <i>will</i> succeed!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41838,
    "Text": "Begone from my memories! Every last trace of you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41839,
    "Text": "We're not going to disappear!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41840,
    "Text": "Aye, we're too stubborn for that!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41841,
    "Text": "We'll get through this, Ryne!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41842,
    "Text": "Yes, together!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41843,
    "Text": "Our friend won't fail us!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41844,
    "Text": "You'd better not, or I'll never let you hear the end of it!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41845,
    "Text": "We won't give up on the future!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41846,
    "Text": "Please, let our prayers be heard!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41847,
    "Text": "If this place cannot be our utopia..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41848,
    "Text": "Then naught in existence holds meaning!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41849,
    "Text": "That's a little melodramatic, don't you think!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41850,
    "Text": "You can weather this! I know you can!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41851,
    "Text": "Yaaaaaargh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41852,
    "Text": "Our promise fades..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41853,
    "Text": "Light and Darkness, gather to me!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41854,
    "Text": "You endure? Another approach, then..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41855,
    "Text": "I am yours, and you are mine!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41856,
    "Text": "What is this!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41857,
    "Text": "I won't let you do as you please!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41858,
    "Text": "What is this!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41859,
    "Text": "Ryne... Are you there?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41860,
    "Text": "Gaia?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41861,
    "Text": "Raaaaaargggh!"
  },
