  {
    "RowId": 41899,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41900,
    "Text": "Let's begin, shall we?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41901,
    "Text": "Can the challenger defeat the wolf in his own lair!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41902,
    "Text": "I wonder if you can keep up..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41903,
    "Text": "Such speed─it's as if there's a pack of him!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41904,
    "Text": "Can you fend off a pack of wolves?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41905,
    "Text": "I do like toying with my prey."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41906,
    "Text": "Fenrir's power can be wielded in surprising ways."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41907,
    "Text": "Where did that colossal thing come from!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41908,
    "Text": "He's put the colossus to the sword!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41909,
    "Text": "Not bad, not bad. But we've scarcely begun."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41910,
    "Text": "Bear my biting winds!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41911,
    "Text": "Still you stand... How delightful!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41912,
    "Text": "With Fenrir's might, I rouse a storm!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41913,
    "Text": "This has gone on long enough. Victory is mine!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41914,
    "Text": "No, I will not lose... I need more power!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41915,
    "Text": "Fenrir's unbound might!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41916,
    "Text": "No matter what becomes of my body...defeat is not an option!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41917,
    "Text": "Something's amiss... What does he intend to do!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41918,
    "Text": "Egads! The ring's been destroyed, and they've fallen below!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41919,
    "Text": "They've moved to floating deathtraps!\nHow will they fight with so little room?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41920,
    "Text": "Now I fight with everything I have! Prepare yourself!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41921,
    "Text": "I will rend all asunder!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41922,
    "Text": "You'll have nowhere to stand!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41923,
    "Text": "He's destroyed an isle! It'll take time to restore it!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41924,
    "Text": "The power of wind unleashed!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41925,
    "Text": "You cannot escape from the wolf!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41926,
    "Text": "I will draw upon my all to defeat you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41927,
    "Text": "Even if it costs me my life..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41928,
    "Text": "Neither side is holding back, but there can be only one champion!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41929,
    "Text": "I will prevail!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41930,
    "Text": "You're strong, I admit... But I'm the one who will win!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41931,
    "Text": "Dodge this if you can!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41932,
    "Text": "Will you be able to stay on your feet?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41933,
    "Text": "Defeat the Howling Blade"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41934,
    "Text": "Aaarrrgh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 41935,
    "Text": "Have at you!"
  },
